criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 18 years;
* Access to internet and having an email address;
* Diagnosis of endometriosis and/or adenomyosis based on gynecological assessment and imaging evaluation, in accordance with ICD-11 classification (WHO, 2019);
* Seeking care at the Endometriosis Center (Department of Obstetrics and Gynecology at Careggi University Hospital (AOUC));
* Ability to provide informed consent;
* Fluency in written and spoken Italian;
* Under stable pharmacological treatment for at least 3 months;
* For Study 1: ≤12 months from diagnosis;
* For Study 2: \>12 months from diagnosis.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Current psychiatric diagnosis assessed with the Structured Clinical Interview for DSM-5 (SCID-5; First et al., 2016);
* Ongoing psychotherapeutic treatment.
